# Code - a code block with a bar (the language or a title) and Copiar; muten code comes highlighted with the same
# grammar as the editor. muten strings cannot hold quotes or braces, so pass the code from a state (or a store),
# not inline. For other languages pass lang: it shows plain.
#   state { snippet = "…" : text }   Code(code: snippet, title: "src/app.muten")
# shadcn-for-muten · Custom · kit.css (.cx-code) · host JS code.js (shares highlight.js).
part Code(code: text, lang: text = "muten", title: text = "") { Custom Code inputs(code: $code, lang: $lang, title: $title) class("cx-code") }
